#: ../../content/legal/terms/partnership.rst:201
msgid ""
"Each Party undertakes to respect all the rights of the other Party in all "
"the items referred to in the previous paragraph and, more particularly, each "
"Party shall refrain from causing any analogy or creating any confusion "
"between their respective company in the mind of the general public."
msgstr ""
